# Decisions: sddra Project Index

Purpose:
  Project-specific decision index for the sddra.ai project.
  Contains all architectural, technical, and operational decisions
  made during the project's lifecycle.

Types:
  architectural: Architecture decisions
  technical: Tech stack choices
  security: Security decisions
  operational: Deployment/ops decisions
  human: Human approvals/rejections
  ai: AI proposals/decisions

States:
  proposed: New decisions awaiting review
  review: Under human review
  approved: Accepted and ready for implementation
  rejected: Not accepted
  superseded: Replaced by a later decision

